    narr:narration """The organization has initiated a [formal migration of its analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_1) from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, a move [ratified as a settled decision](narr:Narrative_InfrastructureMigrationRatification) rather than a proposal. This transition is anchored by a [specific Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_5) and justified through [quantified performance and cost metrics](narr:Narrative_InfrastructureBenefitJustification). The communication of this shift relies on a structured, parallelized format, emphasizing [10x query performance gains](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786699966601_4) and reduced licensing overhead as the primary drivers for the change. While the decision is presented with authoritative finality, the underlying logic remains tethered to a broader, repeatable framework where infrastructure swaps are validated by these specific efficiency benchmarks.""" ;
